      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "s = \"apple,banana,cherry\"\na = s.split(\",\")\n  → ['apple','banana','cherry']\nb = \"-\".join(a)\n  → \"apple-banana-cherry\"\nc = b.replace(\"banana\",\"grape\")\n  → \"apple-grape-cherry\"",
